#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:3
#: 94e1009e2b984d378773ec0a9a67343b
msgid "局部溶剂壳（Solvent Shell）"
msgstr "Local Solvent Shell"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:5
#: 66400c3573844234b485d6e13e14376f
msgid "**分类：** 分子与溶剂"
msgstr "**Category:** Molecules and Solvation"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:7
#: 5600e4f9374448e8937b290a9275d40a
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:9
#: 9b549096a57e4615a5ead14bd3d4c3ff
msgid "在选定宿主原子附近放入一批溶剂分子，生成局部溶剂环境的几何初态。它适合补充离子第一水合壳、溶质附近极性环境或表面局部含水构型；若目标是在整个周期晶胞中填充溶剂，应使用“周期溶剂盒”。"
msgstr ""
"Place solvent molecules near selected host atoms to create starting geometries for a "
"local solvent environment. Use it to add an ion's first hydration shell, a polar "
"environment around a solute, or local water configurations on a surface. To fill an "
"entire periodic cell with solvent, use `Periodic Solvent Box` instead."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:11
#: 1bdfbf5b0b00442b9ba2afa3ba672972
msgid "`每个输出的溶剂分子总数`是在所有选中中心之间共享的总数。例如选择 3 个中心并填写 6，只会总计放入 6 个分子，不是每个中心各放 6 个。"
msgstr ""
"`Total solvent molecules per output` is shared among all selected centers. For "
"example, selecting three centers and entering 6 places six molecules in total, not "
"six around each center."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:13
#: 5fdd2587b8db4ea1a2bb90297c6e4d24
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:15
#: c811948867fa4cf399968bf50cfeaf03
#, python-brace-format
msgid "普通放置先在中心到溶剂质心（COM）的球壳 $[r_{\\min},r_{\\max}]$ 中均匀抽样体积："
msgstr ""
"For ordinary placement, the solvent center of mass (COM) is sampled uniformly by "
"volume within the shell $[r_{\\min},r_{\\max}]$ around a center:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:17
#: de70ee9125fc42f8b273d4dd18a9cf3d
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"r=\\left[r_{\\min}^3+u\\left(r_{\\max}^3-r_{\\min}^3\\right)\\right]^{1/3},\n"
"\\qquad u\\sim U(0,1).\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:22
#: 065177bf9d17466980363fb1e52f7f9d
msgid "若没有填写统一最小距离，任意新旧原子对必须满足"
msgstr ""
"When no global minimum distance is specified, every pair containing at least one "
"newly placed atom must satisfy"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:24
#: 8023d3db99d94621a5369bc80012f6cf
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"d_{ij}\\ge s\\left(R_i+R_j\\right),\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:28
#: 729e5cc390c241418058a75653d84877
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"其中 $R_i$、$R_j$ 是内置元素碰撞半径，$s$ 是解析后的碰撞缩放。填写统一最小距离 $d_0>0$ 后，判据改为 $d_{ij}\\ge "
"d_0$，碰撞缩放不再生效。周期输入使用完整晶胞和 PBC 的精确最小镜像距离，包括一般非正交晶胞。"
msgstr ""
"Here, $R_i$ and $R_j$ are built-in element collision radii and $s$ is the resolved "
"collision scale. When a global minimum distance $d_0>0$ is specified, the criterion "
"becomes $d_{ij}\\ge d_0$ and the collision scale no longer applies. Periodic inputs "
"use exact minimum-image distances for the full cell and PBC, including general non-"
"orthogonal cells."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:30
#: 0e6f23ab1df148c6b2d21a42438f563b
msgid "放置方式"
msgstr "Placement Method"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md
#: 7b636b60c5e044cbb7ba258ae96fe4db
msgid "方式"
msgstr "Mode"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md
#: f44463a8466e4ef08c050cb14a4362dd
msgid "位置与取向"
msgstr "Position and orientation"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md
#: eca842a2e5d5425dbcb128ac042a32de
msgid "碰撞默认值"
msgstr "Default collision scale"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md
#: 7693b95423cd4bfd90232b9b96b5d48e
msgid "自动"
msgstr "Automatic"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md
#: 44f6ff1c49ab4d1198ccd54b3a8ce4a8
msgid "水 + 全部中心均属于支持离子表时使用离子水合；其他水使用水偶极取向；非水使用随机取向"
msgstr ""
"For water, use ion hydration when every center has a supported ion profile; otherwise"
" use water-dipole orientation. Use random orientation for non-water solvents."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md
#: fe07f3433c384f80878a5ef4dceee50a
msgid "随解析结果"
msgstr "Depends on the resolved mode"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md
#: 7444219a79ee424682fcb553fbdacddd
msgid "随机分子取向"
msgstr "Random molecular orientation"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md
#: ee3d4162ae2d46baa7bbaeadd0e4243a
msgid "在备用质心壳层内随机放置和取向"
msgstr "Randomly place and orient molecules within the fallback COM shell"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md
#: 00383766427b4097886057b10165e8a7 e5a0505fcae54fbca59e648038af0b9f
msgid "0.70"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md
#: 233f602e324c4270b5bd1d799bd577ab
msgid "水偶极取向"
msgstr "Water-dipole orientation"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md
#: a867555395ae4c11a41250342d20402a
msgid "在备用质心壳层内放水，使 H 侧大致背离中心"
msgstr ""
"Place water within the fallback COM shell with its H side pointing approximately away"
" from the center"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md
#: 77b237a78c5349e19135546e4e261996
msgid "受支持的离子水合"
msgstr "Supported ion hydration"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md
#: ca16f3b3fd2940c19068de8340b4733f
msgid "按离子–O 距离构造第一水合壳，填满后才使用备用质心壳层"
msgstr ""
"Construct the first hydration shell using ion–O distances; use the fallback COM shell"
" only after the first shell is full"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md
#: b2fb1c2f5a834a0982930dfca9be3a22
msgid "0.72"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md
#: 666a822c9a5a4bf28f78ada91a751b81
msgid "疏松随机放置"
msgstr "Loose random placement"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md
#: b90be20f0c744c6aa5d60b342a9bbd9d
msgid "随机取向，使用较宽松碰撞判据"
msgstr "Use random orientation and a more permissive collision criterion"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md
#: bdaa761c2c8447989d119fbd7cce2c81
msgid "0.62"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md
#: e5735f00c3ef432d9f72c1c2c797e534
msgid "致密水分子放置"
msgstr "Dense water placement"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md
#: 20e68c8d3698409b8c775fea334ff055
msgid "水偶极取向，使用较严格碰撞判据"
msgstr "Use water-dipole orientation and a stricter collision criterion"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md
#: defe46d9956a413990b959607deaaf60
msgid "0.78"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:41
#: a53110eb67344d36bc5bfb32ef07c46e
msgid ""
"离子水合仅支持水分子，以及 Li、Na、K、Mg、Ca、Sr、Ba、Zn "
"中的中心。其他元素在“自动”模式下使用普通水取向；显式选择离子水合则报错，避免把通用经验值伪装成元素专属第一水合壳。"
msgstr ""
"Ion hydration supports only water and centers of Li, Na, K, Mg, Ca, Sr, Ba, or Zn. "
"Other elements use ordinary water orientation in `Automatic` mode. Explicitly "
"selecting ion hydration reports an error, so generic empirical values are not "
"presented as an element-specific first hydration shell."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:43
#: 34b33a8a06a0429da475da81ed6d6c31
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:45
#: e58543c01d934947924ea908ee901567
msgid "训练集缺少 Ca 周围的水合环境时："
msgstr "When the training set lacks hydration environments around Ca:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:47
#: 097ef8418e034f94b0c840cb30a95b6f
msgid "将中心选择设为“按元素”，输入 `Ca`。"
msgstr "Set center selection to `By element` and enter `Ca`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:48
#: df57815f9ccb4716b1b4d863d91cb3c3
msgid "保持“自动选择放置方式”，每个输出总计放入 6 个水分子。"
msgstr ""
"Keep `Choose placement automatically` and place a total of six water molecules in "
"each output."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:49
#: c970cfe0e12f413bae1034b72a0df0ef
msgid "打开固定种子，先生成少量输出。"
msgstr "Enable a fixed seed and generate a small number of outputs first."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:50
#: c68a1470cd2b45c3abb690e7c72c5fc3
msgid "在预览中确认解析为“受支持的离子水合”，Ca–O 第一壳范围为 2.30–2.60 Å、总容量为 6。"
msgstr ""
"Confirm in the preview that the resolved mode is `Supported ion hydration`, with a "
"Ca–O first-shell range of 2.30–2.60 Å and a total capacity of six."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:51
#: ccd9daba2bf34108bb69e76e0ae372d2
msgid "检查输出中的 Ca–O 距离和跨周期边界的短接触，再进行 DFT/力场预松弛。"
msgstr ""
"Inspect Ca–O distances and short contacts across periodic boundaries, then pre-relax "
"the structures with DFT or a force field."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:53
#: cb51d16f70c243aa9a3907734daf3620
msgid "若溶剂总数超过所有选中离子第一壳容量，超出的分子才会使用备用中心到质心壳层。"
msgstr ""
"Only molecules beyond the combined first-shell capacity of all selected ions use the "
"fallback center-to-COM shell."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:55
#: fdf828c0477041f1b8e19462316dee66
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:57
#: 910825c5745545fe8bb216b7325e39a9
msgid "输出"
msgstr "Output"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:59
#: d1aa2099e6e4451db231264a7af3ab4f
msgid "每个输入的独立输出数（structures）"
msgstr "structures"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:61
#: 2b93367a6dfb4e3d8aeb5d63c72a7358
msgid "`int`，默认 1。每个输入结构尝试生成多少个独立溶剂化版本。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default 1. Number of independent solvated variants attempted for each input "
"structure."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:63
#: 5b9a5bcff3a946c980f0103510f9d7a3
msgid "每个输出的溶剂分子总数（solvent_count）"
msgstr "Total Solvent Molecules per Output (solvent_count)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:65
#: 007cc426e6f84173973d0f25e2372af0
msgid "`int`，默认 6。所有选中中心共享的总数。"
msgstr "`int`, default 6. Total count shared among all selected centers."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:67
#: 8cc98276bf4544f7a6329fa1624ec233
msgid "必须放满请求数量（strict_count）"
msgstr "Require the Requested Count (strict_count)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:69
#: c24672ac8eb144bf96e7da3a64ce885a
msgid "`bool`，默认 true。无法放满时整张输出失败；关闭后允许保留至少放入一个分子的部分结果。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default true. If the requested count cannot be placed, the entire output "
"fails. When disabled, a partial result with at least one placed molecule may be "
"retained."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:71
#: bbc6b8dac5d04c5fb6b37cefec35594f
msgid "中心与放置"
msgstr "Centers and Placement"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:73
#: d43b622e82df4738b6e1269e381f1aea
msgid "放置方式（sampling_mode）"
msgstr "Placement Mode (sampling_mode)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:75
#: 88e21fc71f7b4ed0b7e9d7f3e3f3f7d1
msgid "`str`，默认 `auto`。可选 `auto`、`general`、`water`、`ion-water`、`loose`、`dense`，含义见上表。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `auto`. Available values are `auto`, `general`, `water`, `ion-water`, "
"`loose`, and `dense`; see the table above for their meanings."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:77
#: 225ccc7d9fde4ba786d321ce3ba07c68
msgid "中心选择（center_mode）"
msgstr "Center Selection (center_mode)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:79
#: 57cb14a6ac3e4f8db3dd8d128e032783
msgid "`str`，默认 `all`。可选全部宿主原子、按元素、按 1-based 索引、按笛卡尔 z 范围。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `all`. Select all host atoms, by element, by 1-based index, or by a "
"Cartesian z range."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:81
#: 46a1dd292977476f9b6a5f168ac21382
msgid "中心元素（center_elements）"
msgstr "center_elements"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:83
#: 24350c1cd89144f5bd1f1b8cc663d620
msgid "`str`，默认空。按元素选择时填写，例如 `Ca,Na`。"
msgstr "`str`, empty by default. Used for element selection; for example, `Ca,Na`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:85
#: e768fcf196af410cbd0f44e75dcfc573
msgid "中心索引（center_indices）"
msgstr "center_indices"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:87
#: 0abf7f348ea64f92b3e699c80dff71db
msgid "`str`，默认空。按索引选择时填写，例如 `1,3,5-8`。"
msgstr "`str`, empty by default. Used for index selection; for example, `1,3,5-8`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:89
#: 3ed97c2f1aa64c029946585cd4918b5b
msgid "笛卡尔 z 范围（z_range）"
msgstr "Cartesian z Range (z_range)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:91
#: 8d545655cae14ce5a79f2e76cadd2039
msgid "`tuple[float, float]`，默认 `(0.0, 0.0)`，单位 Å。按输入结构的笛卡尔 z 坐标选择中心。"
msgstr ""
"`tuple[float, float]`, default `(0.0, 0.0)`, in Å. Selects centers by their Cartesian"
" z coordinates in the input structure."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:93
#: e9c1767a91a64d89a0e09539d39db5d1
msgid "备用中心到质心壳层（shell）"
msgstr "Fallback Center-to-COM Shell (shell)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:95
#: 8c568d5a4fd140529b2b01681ab7eb3b
msgid "`tuple[float, float]`，默认 `(2.2, 4.5)`，单位 Å。普通放置使用中心到溶剂质心的范围；受支持的第一水合壳填满之前不使用。"
msgstr ""
"`tuple[float, float]`, default `(2.2, 4.5)`, in Å. Ordinary placement uses this "
"center-to-solvent-COM range. It is not used until a supported first hydration shell "
"is full."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:97
#: e3736d5ad1fb4007a0ccb69e96074bea
msgid "碰撞检查"
msgstr "Collision Checks"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:99
#: c0acdb78f0a841aca62b7b2482f776a2
msgid "统一最小距离（min_distance）"
msgstr "Global Minimum Distance (min_distance)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:101
#: d4c2272137264eadb7e62ffe84a12ed5
msgid "`float`，默认 0，单位 Å。正数覆盖所有元素半径判据；0 使用元素半径。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default 0, in Å. A positive value overrides all element-radius criteria; 0 "
"uses element radii."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:103
#: 47fbd5922d724436822f24889c153dfc
msgid "元素半径碰撞缩放（collision_scale）"
msgstr "collision_scale"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:105
#: 4fe17641409b4df3beeeb17e7a03837d
msgid "`float`，默认 0。0 使用放置方式的默认值；仅在 `min_distance=0` 时生效。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default 0. A value of 0 uses the placement mode's default. This parameter "
"applies only when `min_distance=0`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:107
#: 8d8ec612277c49d288662909c7f44278
msgid "每个输出的放置尝试次数（max_attempts）"
msgstr "Placement Attempts per Output (max_attempts)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:109
#: a973d808cd3440b18916f9671156c6d4
msgid "`int`，默认 3000。一个输出内所有溶剂分子共享的总尝试预算。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default 3000. Total attempt budget shared by all solvent molecules within one "
"output."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:111
#: 613f855ee5e24f36b17da334f7433f5c
msgid "非周期显示盒"
msgstr "Nonperiodic Display Box"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:113
#: 79fb766b1e884c23bb12932b9fc09cb2
msgid "这些参数仅在输入没有有效晶胞时生效；已有 cell 和 PBC 会原样保留。"
msgstr ""
"These parameters apply only when the input has no valid cell. An existing cell and "
"PBC are preserved unchanged."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:115
#: 0fd2e4b23d2c48deaa59787cfe0a35fe
msgid "自动设置显示盒（auto_box）"
msgstr "Set Display Box Automatically (auto_box)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:117
#: 52ddb7d3d0b04730a8eeed45f7fd091d
msgid "`bool`，默认 false。按最终坐标包围盒设置非周期显示盒。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default false. Sets the nonperiodic display box from the final coordinate "
"bounding box."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:119
#: a41bc4b6c2e1424b8a6f6962da8dd59f
msgid "固定显示盒（box_size）"
msgstr "Fixed Display Box (box_size)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:121
#: 772999cb14be44d4ab698a7bd9ce007e
msgid "`float`，默认 100.0 Å。`auto_box=false` 时使用的立方显示盒边长。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default 100.0 Å. Side length of the cubic display box used when "
"`auto_box=false`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:123
#: d28793593ba94fbf813a0ae4e1df6710
msgid "自动显示盒留白（box_padding）"
msgstr "Automatic Box Padding (box_padding)"

