#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:167
#: 1eff6ad3c214492e8baa8bbfd60ca83d
msgid "输出与检查"
msgstr "Output and Checks"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:169
#: ca71d781ad464c2894f3c70d7f89a1bc
msgid "输出保留宿主结构的 cell、PBC、info 和 arrays，并追加标签："
msgstr ""
"The output preserves the host structure's cell, PBC, `info`, and `arrays`, and "
"appends the label:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:171
#: 85519a5867e748608c2a8d17b34a8013
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`SolvLocal(mode={mode},n={placed},sel={center_count})`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:173
#: 15e0270e225d44bdbd9b0dca2bd623f3
msgid "建议重点检查：实际放入数量、中心到 O/质心距离、非键短接触，以及预松弛后溶剂壳是否仍稳定。"
msgstr ""
"Inspect the number actually placed, center-to-O or center-to-COM distances, short "
"nonbonded contacts, and whether the solvent shell remains stable after pre-"
"relaxation."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:175
#: 052953d0e81946788e1ceecdbbd57a91
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:177
#: 8c0818fa7b8e4a4ebdf84f38c2d91d53
msgid "**为什么调节备用壳层后 Ca–O 没有变化？** 第一水合壳使用离子专属的 ion–O 范围；备用壳层只用于超出第一壳容量的分子。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does changing the fallback shell not affect Ca–O distances?** The first "
"hydration shell uses an ion-specific ion–O range. The fallback shell is used only for"
" molecules beyond the first-shell capacity."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:178
#: a530ddd2eb0e445d932253d13c5a7fca
msgid "**为什么多个中心没有各自得到设定数量？** `solvent_count` 是所有中心共享的总数。需要更多覆盖时提高总数，并检查实际中心分配。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does each of several centers not receive the specified count?** `solvent_count`"
" is the total shared by all centers. Increase the total for broader coverage and "
"inspect the actual distribution among centers."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:179
#: 02bbb89474494ab8b4771c4652d16be4
msgid "**为什么一直无法放满？** 减少溶剂总数、扩大壳层或可用空间，并检查统一最小距离是否过大。"
msgstr ""
"**Why can the requested count never be reached?** Reduce the solvent count, enlarge "
"the shell or available space, and check whether the global minimum distance is too "
"large."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`Local Solvation` "
#~ "在选中原子周围插入一批溶剂分子，用来补充离子水合壳、局部极性环境、溶质附近初始溶剂排布等候选构型。它只生成几何初态，不做力场或 DFT "
#~ "优化。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Local Solvation` inserts solvent molecules around"
#~ " selected atoms to generate candidate ion "
#~ "hydration shells, local polar environments, or "
#~ "initial solvent arrangements near a solute. It"
#~ " creates geometry only and performs neither "
#~ "force-field nor DFT optimization."

#~ msgid "这张卡保留输入结构，并追加溶剂原子；输出会写入 `SolvLocal(...)` 标签，便于后续在 `NEP Dataset Display` 中筛选。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The input structure is retained and solvent"
#~ " atoms are appended. Output receives a "
#~ "`SolvLocal(...)` label for later filtering in "
#~ "`NEP Dataset Display`."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "参数设置：`center_mode=\"elements\"`，`center_elements=\"Ca\"`，`sampling_mode=\"auto\"`，`solvent_count=6`，`shell=(2.6,"
#~ " 3.4)`，`min_distance=0.8`，打开 `use_seed`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Parameters: `center_mode=\"elements\"`, `center_elements=\"Ca\"`, "
#~ "`sampling_mode=\"auto\"`, `solvent_count=6`, `shell=(2.6,3.4)`, "
#~ "`min_distance=0.8`, and `use_seed` enabled."

#~ msgid "`int`，默认 30。每个输出结构插入多少个溶剂分子。离子第一壳通常从 4-8 开始；大分子局部溶剂环境再按中心原子数量扩大。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default `30`. Solvent molecules inserted "
#~ "per output. Start around 4-8 for a first"
#~ " ion shell and scale deliberately for "
#~ "larger solutes or multiple centers."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`str`，默认 `auto`。可选 `auto`、`general`、`water`、`ion-"
#~ "water`、`loose`、`dense`。`auto` 会在水分子和离子中心同时出现时使用 `ion-"
#~ "water`，只有水分子时使用 `water`，否则使用 `general`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, default `auto`. Options are `auto`, "
#~ "`general`, `water`, `ion-water`, `loose`, and "
#~ "`dense`. Auto selects `ion-water` for water"
#~ " around ionic centers, `water` for water "
#~ "otherwise, and `general` for other solvents."

#~ msgid "`str`，默认 `all`。可选 `all`、`elements`、`indices`、`z_range`。这决定哪些原子作为局部溶剂化中心。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, default `all`. One of `all`, "
#~ "`elements`, `indices`, or `z_range`; selects "
#~ "solvation centers."

#~ msgid "`tuple[float, float]`，默认 `(2.2, 4.5)`，单位 Å。局部溶剂中心到溶剂分子参考位置的采样壳层。外半径必须大于内半径。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`tuple[float,float]`, default `(2.2,4.5)` Å. Radial "
#~ "shell for the solvent reference position "
#~ "around a center. Outer radius must exceed "
#~ "inner radius."

#~ msgid "`float`，默认 0。大于 0 时作为全局原子-原子最小距离；等于 0 时使用元素碰撞半径和 `collision_scale`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default `0`. A positive value is "
#~ "the global minimum atom-atom distance. At "
#~ "`0`, element-specific collision radii scaled "
#~ "by `collision_scale` are used."

#~ msgid "`float`，默认 0。等于 0 时使用 `sampling_mode` 的内置半径缩放；大于 0 时覆盖模式默认值。它控制插入溶剂与已有原子之间的非键接触下限。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default `0`. Zero uses the "
#~ "sampling-mode collision scale; a positive value"
#~ " overrides it as a global minimum nonbonded"
#~ " contact distance."

#~ msgid "`int`，默认 3000。每个输出结构的最大插入尝试次数。达到上限仍插不满时，`strict_count=True` 会报错。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default `3000`. Maximum placement attempts"
#~ " per output. If the target is not "
#~ "reached, `strict_count=True` raises an error."

#~ msgid "`bool`，默认 true。打开后，未插满 `solvent_count` 就失败；关闭后允许输出部分插入结果。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`bool`, default `true`. Fail unless all "
#~ "requested molecules are inserted; disabled permits"
#~ " partial output."

#~ msgid "`bool`，默认 false。打开后按输出坐标自动生成非周期盒子。"
#~ msgstr "`bool`, default `false`. Build a nonperiodic cell around output coordinates."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`float`，默认 100.0，单位 Å。输入没有有效 cell 且 `auto_box=False`"
#~ " 时，输出会居中放入这个固定盒子；这对应原脚本的 `-box` 默认行为。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default `100.0` Å. Fixed box used "
#~ "when the input lacks a valid cell and"
#~ " `auto_box=False`."

#~ msgid "`bool`，默认 false。打开后复用仓库已有 torsion-guard core 生成溶剂构象池，再用于插入。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`bool`, default `false`. Use the existing "
#~ "torsion-guard core to build a solvent "
#~ "conformer pool before insertion."

#~ msgid "`tuple[float, float]`，默认 `(-180.0, 180.0)`，单位 degree。柔性构象生成时的扭转角范围。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`tuple[float, float]`, default `(-180.0, 180.0)` "
#~ "degrees. Torsion-angle range used to generate"
#~ " flexible conformers."

#~ msgid "没有选到中心原子：检查 `center_mode` 是否和 `center_elements`、`center_indices` 或 `z_range` 匹配。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "No centers selected: check that mode and "
#~ "its element, index, or z-range parameter match"
#~ " the input."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "一直插不满目标数量：降低 `solvent_count`，放宽 `shell`，减小 `min_distance` "
#~ "或 `collision_scale`；如果目标是周期整盒溶剂，优先改用 `Solvent Box Fill`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Cannot reach the target count: reduce count,"
#~ " widen the shell, or revise collision "
#~ "limits. For a full periodic solvent box, "
#~ "use `Solvent Box Fill` instead."

#~ msgid "输出有明显短接触：增大 `min_distance` 或 `collision_scale`，再接 `Geometry Filter` 和 DFT/MD 预松弛。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Obvious short contacts: increase collision "
#~ "separation, apply `Geometry Filter`, and pre-"
#~ "relax with DFT or MD."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "打开 `use_seed` 后，相同输入结构、结构顺序、参数和 `seed` "
#~ "会生成相同插入结果。若输入结构顺序、中心原子集合或溶剂分子文本发生变化，输出也会随之变化。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "With `use_seed`, identical structures, order, "
#~ "parameters, centers, solvent text, and seed "
#~ "reproduce insertion. Changing any of those can"
#~ " change output."

#~ msgid "局部溶剂壳（Local Solvation）"
#~ msgstr "Local Solvation"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`Local Solvation` "
#~ "在选中原子周围插入一批溶剂分子，用来补充离子水合壳、局部极性环境、溶质附近初始溶剂排布等候选构型。它只生成几何初态，不做力场或 DFT "
#~ "优化，也不保证得到平衡溶剂化数或平衡取向。"
#~ msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "这张卡保留输入结构，并追加溶剂原子；碰撞检查只负责排除明显短接触。`Auto` "
#~ "会根据溶剂是否为一水分子以及中心元素是否包含内置离子来解析实际放置模式。卡片首帧预览会显示中心数、溶剂分子式、解析后的模式和真正采用的碰撞规则。"
#~ msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "程序先按中心选择规则得到中心原子集合 $\\mathcal C$，再在球壳 $r_{\\min}\\le r\\le"
#~ " r_{\\max}$ 中抽样溶剂质心。若按体积均匀采样，半径可写为"
#~ msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "每个候选分子还会随机取向，并对宿主、已放置溶剂及周期镜像执行碰撞检查。`自动/水/疏松/ "
#~ "致密`模式选择不同的预设碰撞尺度和采样策略；用户显式填写碰撞尺度时覆盖预设。柔性构象 "
#~ "选项会先生成有限构象池再参与放置，不是在放置过程中做分子动力学。达到尝试上限仍无合法 位置时会失败，不会把重叠结构当作成功结果。"
#~ msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#~ msgid "场景：模型没有见过离子第一水合壳"
#~ msgstr "Scenario: The first hydration shell of an ion is missing"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "你训练了含 Ca 的体系，但训练集里 Ca 周围几乎都是干结构。模型在含水环境里预测 Ca-O "
#~ "局部相互作用时异常。先用 `Local Solvation` 选中 Ca 原子，插入 4-8"
#~ " 个水分子，生成候选水合壳，再经过几何检查和 DFT 松弛。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "A Ca-containing training set is almost "
#~ "entirely dry and gives abnormal Ca-O "
#~ "interactions in water. Select Ca centers and"
#~ " insert 4-8 water molecules to propose "
#~ "hydration shells, then apply geometry checks "
#~ "and DFT relaxation before using them as "
#~ "labels."

#~ msgid "参数设置：中心选择“按元素”并填 `Ca`，放置模式选“自动识别溶剂 / 离子”，每个输出放 6 个水分子，统一最小距离可先设为 `0.8 Å`，打开固定种子。"
#~ msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "在 `ion-water` 模式下，Ca 第一配位壳的 O 原子距离来自内置 "
#~ "`2.30–2.60 Å` 区间；界面上的“备用质心壳层”只在该离子的内置配位数填满之后使用。不要把备用壳层误认为第一壳 "
#~ "Ca–O 距离。"
#~ msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#~ msgid "检查输出时重点看 Ca-O 距离、短 H-H/O-H 非键接触、以及 DFT 松弛后是否仍保持合理水合结构。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Inspect Ca-O distances, short nonbonded H-H/O-H "
#~ "contacts, and whether the shell remains "
#~ "physically meaningful after DFT relaxation."

#~ msgid "溶剂输入"
#~ msgstr "Solvent input"

#~ msgid "`str`，默认是一个三原子水分子 XYZ。这里保存的是溶剂分子文本，而不是文件路径，因此 card JSON 可以脱离原始文件复现。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, default a three-atom water XYZ "
#~ "block. The parameter stores molecule text "
#~ "rather than a path, allowing card JSON "
#~ "to reproduce the input without the original"
#~ " file."

#~ msgid "`int`，默认 6。每个输出结构插入多少个溶剂分子。离子第一壳通常从 4–8 开始；大分子局部溶剂环境再按中心原子数量扩大。"
#~ msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#~ msgid "`str`，默认 `auto`。可选项："
#~ msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#~ msgid "`auto`：水 + 内置离子中心时解析为 `ion-water`；只有水时解析为 `water`；其他溶剂解析为 `general`。"
#~ msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#~ msgid "`ion-water`：内置离子的前若干个水使用元素专属 ion–O 区间并让 H 侧背离离子；达到内置配位数后回到备用质心壳层。"
#~ msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

